ransform=\"translate(113.520333 82.301024) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"IBMPlexSans-Regular-8f\" d=\"M 2163 397 L 1677 397 L 1677 1734 L 429 1734 L 429 2170 L 1677 2170 L 1677 3507 L 2163 3507 L 2163 2170 L 3411 2170 L 3411 1734 L 2163 1734 L 2163 397 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-8f\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3c\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-5a\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3c\" transform=\"translate(147.203125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3f\" transform=\"translate(207.203125 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_15\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(181.891875 44.593174) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-8f\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3b\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-5a\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3f\" transform=\"translate(147.203125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3f\" transform=\"translate(207.203125 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_16\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(250.263417 15.4) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-8f\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3b\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-5a\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3c\" transform=\"translate(147.203125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-38\" transform=\"translate(207.203125 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_17\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(321.034958 15.4) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3f\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-5a\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-42\" transform=\"translate(87.203125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-40\" transform=\"translate(147.203125 0)\"/></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p7ad0159b52\"><rect x=\"19.6\" y=\"10.472\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"149.688\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Contribution per order ($)","note":null},"answer":"<ul><li><b>Batch orders</b> (two orders per courier trip, cutting courier cost 30%): +$2.25 → $3.11</li> <li><b>Bigger baskets</b> ($45 → $55 via a minimum order and suggestions): +$1.55 → $4.66</li> <li><b>Cut promotions</b> to $0.80 by targeting them at new customers only: +$1.20 → <b>$5.86</b></li></ul> <p>With all three: $5.86 × 1.2M = <b>$7.0M</b>, above the $6M of fixed costs.</p>"},{"q":"What could stop this working?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li>Batching may slow deliveries, LeafCart's main selling point; offer a cheaper 'within 2 hours' option</li> <li>A minimum basket may push away small top-up orders</li><li>Cutting promotions could slow growth; measure repeat rates by cohort</li></ul>"}],"reco":"LeafCart can become profitable, but not through volume: it earns only $0.86 an order, so it would need about 5.8× today's orders to cover fixed costs. Batching deliveries, raising the average basket to $55 and targeting promotions at new customers would lift contribution to about $5.86 an order, about $7.0M a year against $6M of fixed costs. Risk: slower or less convenient delivery. Next step: trial batching and a minimum basket in two neighbourhoods.","great":["Builds contribution per order line by line","Shows that volume alone can't fix it","Sizes each lever in dollars per order","Checks the result against fixed costs"],"id":72,"slug":"leafcart"}